    <briefdescription>
<para>Simple wrapper observer that takes several observers, and calls each one for each event. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>If there are multiple observers (say CSE, <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_legalizer" kindref="compound">Legalizer</ref>, <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_combiner" kindref="compound">Combiner</ref>), it&apos;s sufficient to register this to the machine function as the delegate. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
